    "background_story": "Graham was a charismatic entrepreneur with a flair for the dramatic. He made his fortune in the luxury goods industry, building a brand synonymous with opulence and extravagance. His company, 'Graham's Tushery', catered to the whims of the ultra-rich, offering bespoke, one-of-a-kind items that redefined the concept of indulgence. From diamond-encrusted phone cases to solid gold toilet seats, Graham's creations were the epitome of tushery. His clients adored him for his impeccable taste and ability to deliver the impossible. Graham's success was not just about the products he created, but the experience he offered \u2013 a chance to live like royalty, if only for a moment. His name became a byword for excess, and his brand a status symbol for those who dared to dream big.",
